From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 16:59:19 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] d3d9: palettes, Ex present statistics, GPU priority, vblank
 wait, Ex plain surfaces

Set/GetPaletteEntries and Set/GetCurrentTexturePalette keep their values.
Swapchain GetLastPresentCount / GetPresentStatistics count presents (swapchain
Present and device PresentEx). Set/GetGPUThreadPriority keep a value in -7..7.
WaitForVBlank sleeps to the next edge of a refresh period. CheckResourceResidency
validates and answers S_OK. SetConvolutionMonoKernel validates and keeps the
kernel. CreateOffscreenPlainSurfaceEx forwards to CreateOffscreenPlainSurface and
refuses any usage (checked by the d3d9ex tests; their todo_wine marks are removed).
The PIX marker entry points trace only.

